{"id":"5130253b-e1ae-5e03-bf87-ec58d245de28","title":"Page 与 Board","icon":"🧩","cover":"none","parentId":null,"favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"Page 与 Board","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"手动建页 · 两种原生容器","title":"自己动手建一页","lead":"不经过 Agent，也可以在工作台里新建项目和页面。Page 是顺序排版的页面，适合文档、报告和网页；Board 是可以平移、缩放、绘画和自由摆放的白板。两者可以互相嵌套，放进同一份文件里。","facts":[{"label":"新建默认","value":"Page"},{"label":"白板缩放","value":"10%–400%"},{"label":"嵌套","value":"Page ⇄ Board 递归"},{"label":"撤销","value":"所有层级共享"}],"art":"workbench"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-d7b27988"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-d8b27b1b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"手动建一页"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"快速上手","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" 让 Agent 做出第一个界面；这里是不经过 Agent、自己动手的做法。两种方式得到的是同一种页面，之后都可以交给 Agent 接着改。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d9b27cae"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"新建项目","body":"在侧栏点「新建项目」，输入名称。项目把相关的页面、文件夹、组件和模板归在一起，例如「文献阅读」「产品调研」各建一个。","result":"项目出现在侧栏中，内容为空。"},{"title":"添加 Page 或 Board","body":"点左上角的 **+**，或打开文件夹的新建菜单，选择「Page 空白页面」或「Board 白板」。写文章、笔记和报告用 Page；要自由摆放、画关系图时用 Board。"},{"title":"输入内容，用 `/` 插入组件","body":"在 Page 里直接输入文字，输入 `/` 搜索并插入表格、图表、图片等组件，插入后可以继续编辑参数。在 Board 上，在空白处按 `/`，或右键选择「添加组件…」。","result":"组件出现在光标位置，前后的文字保持不动。"},{"title":"确认已经保存","body":"工作台自动保存，也可以按 `Cmd+S`（macOS）或 `Ctrl+S`（Windows / Linux）。","result":"保存状态显示「本机已保存」。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-dab27e41"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"侧栏的「模板」里有已经组织好的页面结构，应用后得到一份独立页面，可以继续填写和调整，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"组件与模板","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。下面介绍两种容器各适合什么、怎样嵌套，以及白板的编辑方法。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-dbb27fd4"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-dcb28167"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"先选对容器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"写给人顺着读的内容用 Page；需要摆放、比较、圈画的内容用 Board。拿不准时从 Page 开始，需要空间关系的那一块再嵌一个 Board。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ddb282fa"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-compare","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":[{"id":"page","label":"Page","sub":"顺序排版的页面","tone":"brand"},{"id":"board","label":"Board","sub":"空间型白板","tone":"teal"}],"rows":[{"group":"内容怎么排","label":"子内容的位置","values":{"page":"按内容顺序从上到下","board":"相对白板的 x、y 坐标"}},{"group":"内容怎么排","label":"适合的内容","values":{"page":"文档、报告、网页、讲解","board":"分析图、看板、关系梳理、草图"}},{"group":"内容怎么排","label":"画笔、矩形、椭圆、箭头","values":{"page":false,"board":true}},{"group":"内容怎么排","label":"阅读顺序","hint":"线性导出与阅读投影使用","values":{"page":"就是内容顺序","board":"单独保存，可调整"}},{"group":"怎么浏览","label":"滚动","values":{"page":"原生纵向滚动、文字选择、输入法","board":"平移画布；阅读时带弹性阻力"}},{"group":"怎么浏览","label":"缩放","values":{"page":false,"board":"10%–400%，围绕指针"}},{"group":"怎么浏览","label":"小地图","values":{"page":false,"board":"整页 Board 的工具栏可打开"}},{"group":"嵌进另一个容器时","label":"默认外框","values":{"page":"固定阅读窗口，可改为随内容增长","board":"固定高度窗口，内部绘画不会撑开文章"}},{"group":"嵌进另一个容器时","label":"阅读锁","values":{"page":false,"board":"有，首次显示默认锁定"}}],"note":"新建内容时，左上角 + 或文件夹的新建菜单里有「Page 空白页面」和「Board 白板」；之后也能用「放入 Page / 放入 Board」给已有内容加一层外壳。"},"integrity":"sha256-3a5b6ff02c26c6d04060377c93d47041a961d40fcd062e5944842df3976755d0"},"id":"node-deb2848d"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-cfb26cf0"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"插入内容和容器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Page 和 Board 与 Markdown、图片、图表一样列在组件库里，搜索、预览、插入的方式完全相同。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d0b26e83"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 Page 里","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：输入 "},{"type":"text","text":"/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 打开插入菜单，直接搜索组件名，例如「白板」「思维导图」。插入位置就是光标所在处，前后文字保持完整。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6e303989"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-58dbc53e"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 Board 里","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：在空白处按 "},{"type":"text","text":"/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，或右键选择「添加组件…」；双击空白处直接写文字，P 画笔、R 矩形。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e9f5c35e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-59dbc6d1"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"给已有内容加外壳","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：在容器操作菜单中选择「放入 Page」或「放入 Board」，原来的节点成为新容器的子节点，身份和内容不变。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-191ef7bf"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-56dbc218"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4bf7e4b1"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"页面末尾可以继续在普通空白段落里输入。已有的顺序、网格、自由分组仍可编辑，在「模块设置」的「区域布局」里切换。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4af7e31e"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-49f7e18b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"外框归父级，布局归自己"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"每个嵌入的容器都有两层设定："},{"type":"text","text":"父级决定它的位置和外框","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，"},{"type":"text","text":"它自己决定内部怎么排","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。点开下图中的节点看看各自管什么。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-48f7dff8"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-diagram","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"id":"root","label":"根 Page","sub":"整份页面","col":0,"row":1,"tone":"brand","detail":"页面的最外层。它没有父级外框，子内容按顺序排列，读者纵向滚动阅读。"},{"id":"text","label":"正文与组件","sub":"按顺序排列","col":1,"row":0,"tone":"slate","detail":"正文、文本模块与流式内容共用一个编辑器，光标、选区和键盘导航可以连续穿过它们。悬停或选中都不会给内容加外框。"},{"id":"board","label":"嵌入的 Board","sub":"固定高度窗口","col":1,"row":2,"tone":"teal","detail":"父级 Page 给它一个固定高度的窗口，内部画得再大也不会撑开文章。嵌入时右上角有阅读锁，默认锁定。"},{"id":"inner","label":"Board 里的 Page","sub":"固定阅读窗口","col":2,"row":1,"tone":"brand","detail":"Board 用本地坐标给它定位。默认是固定阅读窗口，可以在里面上下阅读；在「模块设置 → 高度方式」可改为「随内容增长」。"},{"id":"draw","label":"绘画","sub":"画笔、形状、箭头","col":2,"row":2,"tone":"warm","detail":"只属于 Board。笔画点位按自身外框的本地坐标保存，放大缩小父级不会改写笔画。箭头可以绑定到同级对象上，对象移动时端点跟着走。"},{"id":"widget","label":"组件","sub":"图表、导图…","col":2,"row":3,"tone":"violet","detail":"在 Board 上的组件同样由 Board 决定位置和外框；已选组件上的点击交给组件自己处理。"}],"edges":[{"from":"root","to":"text","label":"顺序"},{"from":"root","to":"board","label":"外框"},{"from":"board","to":"inner","label":"坐标"},{"from":"board","to":"draw","label":"坐标"},{"from":"board","to":"widget","label":"坐标"}],"groups":[{"label":"Page 的子节点","from":[1,0],"to":[1,2],"tone":"brand"},{"label":"Board 的子节点","from":[2,1],"to":[2,3],"tone":"teal"}],"initial":"board","caption":"所有层级共用一个文件、一套保存机制和一份撤销历史。"},"integrity":"sha256-9ceb1b83b7337bd71c87cce10635d090629d4226ec970470ceee8ab26cee0038"},"id":"node-4ff7eafd"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下面就是一块真实的嵌入 Board。滚动经过它时，外层页面照常滚动；点右上角的锁形图标解锁，就能在里面缩放和平移。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4ef7e96a"}},{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"pb-demo-board","kind":"board","name":"示例白板"},"content":[{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"pb-demo-page","kind":"page","name":"白板里的 Page"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我在白板上有自己的位置和外框，里面仍按顺序排版。内容超出外框时，在窗口里上下阅读。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2a0df44f"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在工作台中单击选中我，拖动即可移动；用「展开容器」可以在更大的工作区里编辑我。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-290df2bc"}}]},{"type":"drawing","attrs":{"id":"pb-demo-arrow","name":"箭头","tool":"arrow","color":"#2e3bc9","strokeWidth":2.5,"extent":[90,24],"points":[{"x":2,"y":12},{"x":88,"y":12}]}},{"type":"drawing","attrs":{"id":"pb-demo-frame","name":"圈注","tool":"rectangle","color":"#bf6528","strokeWidth":2,"extent":[400,230],"points":[{"x":0,"y":0},{"x":400,"y":230}]}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"id":"pb-demo-metrics","kind":"metrics","data":{"title":"白板视图","items":[{"label":"最大缩放","value":"400%","detail":"最小 10%，捏合或 ⌘/Ctrl + 滚轮"},{"label":"嵌入时","value":"锁定","detail":"右上角解锁后才能缩放、平移"}]}}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-4cf7e644"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"展开、返回上层与撤销"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"容器外框上的展开按钮会在更大的工作区里编辑"},{"type":"text","text":"同一个节点","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，不会复制出新页面。工作区顶部的「内容层级」显示当前路径，「返回上层」回到父级视图。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-43f7d819"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"移动整个模块用外框手柄，编辑内容用文字或内部控件。跨容器移动、删除、绘画、包裹都能撤销；个人的滚动、相机位置和选择只保存在本机，不算内容修改。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-42f7d686"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-51fa2cba"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"在 Board 上编辑"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"选择与移动","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：单击对象选中，按住任意位置拖动即移动；再单击已选文字进入编辑（回车也可以），Escape 退出编辑并保持选中。空白处拖动是框选。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ea8b7965"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5b7c05c2"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"修饰键","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：Shift 拖动锁定水平或垂直；Alt 拖动复制出副本；Alt 调整尺寸以中心为基准；⌘/Ctrl 暂时关闭吸附。画形状时 Shift 约束比例，Alt 从中心画。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6563809a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5c7c0755"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"工具栏","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：可以拖到画布上、下、左、右任一边停靠，位置保存在本机。选中对象后，复制、层级、对齐与分布、放入区域、锁定和删除出现在工具栏的选中区。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-948cb4fb"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-597c029c"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"区域","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：用区域工具（F）画一个框，完全落在其中的对象会被收进区域；区域的空白内部不遮挡下面的对象。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6ec5ef90"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5a7c042f"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"锁定对象","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：锁定后不能拖动、缩放或被框选，但仍可单击选中，再从菜单或 ⇧⌘L 解锁。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3e3e3eb1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-577bff76"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-52fa2e4d"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"画完一个图形后当前工具保持不变，方便连续画；刚画的对象不会被自动选中。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4ffa2994"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-50fa2b27"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"快捷键"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在白板上用快捷键前先点一下画布。数字 1–9 依次对应工具栏前九个工具。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4dfa266e"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-commands","version":"1.0.0","props":{"placeholder":"搜索快捷键或操作，例如 对齐、R、缩放","groups":[{"id":"tools","label":"工具"},{"id":"view","label":"视图"},{"id":"edit","label":"编辑"},{"id":"arrange","label":"层级与对齐"}],"commands":[{"group":"tools","command":"V  ·  1","summary":"选择"},{"group":"tools","command":"P  ·  2","summary":"画笔"},{"group":"tools","command":"H  ·  3","summary":"荧光笔"},{"group":"tools","command":"R  ·  4","summary":"矩形","detail":"Shift 约束比例，Alt 从中心绘制，⌘/Ctrl 关闭吸附。"},{"group":"tools","command":"E / O  ·  5","summary":"椭圆"},{"group":"tools","command":"A  ·  6","summary":"箭头","detail":"端点落在同级对象上时会绑定到该对象，对象移动、缩放或旋转时端点跟随。"},{"group":"tools","command":"F  ·  7","summary":"区域","detail":"完全落在区域里的对象会被收入区域。"},{"group":"tools","command":"M  ·  8","summary":"移动画布","detail":"也可以按住空格或鼠标中键拖动；编辑文字时空格用于输入。"},{"group":"tools","command":"X  ·  9","summary":"笔迹橡皮"},{"group":"tools","command":"L","summary":"套索选择"},{"group":"tools","command":"T","summary":"文字","detail":"单击放置文字，或直接双击空白处。"},{"group":"view","command":"⇧1","summary":"总览全部内容"},{"group":"view","command":"⇧2","summary":"定位所选内容"},{"group":"view","command":"⇧0","summary":"回到 100%"},{"group":"view","command":"+  /  -","summary":"放大、缩小","detail":"⌘/Ctrl 组合键交给应用本身的缩放。"},{"group":"view","command":"Escape","summary":"取消当前绘画或操作，再按一次退出当前层级"},{"group":"edit","command":"⌘C  /  ⌘X  /  ⌘V","summary":"拷贝、剪切、粘贴","detail":"粘贴纯文本时生成文字对象。"},{"group":"edit","command":"⌘D","summary":"复制所选对象","detail":"也可以按住 Alt 拖动。"},{"group":"edit","command":"方向键  ·  Shift + 方向键","summary":"微移所选对象（Shift 为 10 倍）","detail":"按住连续微移只算一次撤销。"},{"group":"edit","command":"⇧⌘L","summary":"锁定或解锁所选对象"},{"group":"edit","command":"⌘Z  /  ⇧⌘Z","summary":"撤销、重做","detail":"Windows 与 Linux 上用 Ctrl 代替 ⌘。"},{"group":"arrange","command":"]  /  [","summary":"上移一层、下移一层"},{"group":"arrange","command":"⇧]  /  ⇧[","summary":"置于顶层、置于底层"},{"group":"arrange","command":"⌥A  /  ⌥H  /  ⌥D","summary":"左对齐、水平居中、右对齐"},{"group":"arrange","command":"⌥W  /  ⌥V  /  ⌥S","summary":"顶部对齐、垂直居中、底部对齐"},{"group":"arrange","command":"⌥⇧H  /  ⌥⇧V","summary":"水平、垂直等距分布"},{"group":"arrange","command":"⌘G  /  ⇧⌘G","summary":"放入区域、解除区域"}]},"integrity":"sha256-f2cb922c18c3fa9d4f1aab66332746643bedee46148b4975f3ca1e16a32d3f52"},"id":"node-4efa2801"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-4bfa2348"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"阅读锁：滚动页面，还是操作里面的内容"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"嵌在页面里的可缩放内容会和页面滚动抢手势。阅读锁解决这个问题：锁定时滚动交给外层页面，点击、右键、提示和内部编辑控件照常工作。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4cfa24db"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-909dfd3d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ccd5802a"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"是否有阅读锁"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eb75d212"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cdd581bd"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"说明"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1b8c8913"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cad57d04"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-88f70bc5"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"整页 Board、展开后的 Board 工作区"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9f3297fa"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d15edeb5"}},{"type":"tableCell",